ll><b>The wells fell silent. One drop remained.</b></span></div><p className="keeper-line">“Whether I am the last Wellkeeper or the first of a returning line depends on what we awaken together.”</p><button className="primary" onClick={()=>setWellLore(false)}>Continue with the Wellkeeper</button></>}</div></section></div>}
